  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Addressing critical protection and basic needs of Rohingya refugees in Indonesia and Thailand</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Continued maritime movements from Bangladesh and Rakhine State toward Malaysia, transiting through Thailand and Indonesia, have intensified in 2025, exposing refugees to severe protection risks. Through this Action, IOM will deliver life saving, multi sectoral humanitarian assistance to Rohingya refugees in Indonesia and Thailand, alongside targeted protection interventions, change driven advocacy, and actionable data to inform analysis and operational responses at the regional level.</narrative>
  </description>
